  "above_fold_text": "GDPR Cookie Banner We use cookies to provide the services and features offered on our website and to improve our user experience. Click for details . Accept Close GDPR Cookie Banner Meet with Us Locations Careers Search Log In Bluestone Bank Personal Business Home Loans Wealth & Trust Services Municipal Resources About Us YOUR BIG PLANS backed by Bluestone Nurture your hard-earned money with competitive interest rates on deposit products. Open an Account Bluestone’s Season of Giving and Savings Learn More about Bluestone’s Season of Giving and Savings MAXIMIZE YOUR SAVINGS Earn over 8x the National Average* Savings Rate Learn More about our High-Yield Savings Account Mobile Banking App Securely manage your accounts, transfer funds, and access all your financial tools with just a few taps. Learn More about our Mobile Banking App (opens in a new tab) (opens in a new tab) How do I… Choose a selection Your partner through it all. We’re an independent community bank located in southeastern Massachusetts and are proud to back the communities we call home. We have helped our local area flourish since 1872 and are dedicated to providing caring service and financial insight to families and businesses in Massachusetts, Rhode Island, and New Hampshire—come bank with us! Meet with Us",
  "visible_text": "GDPR Cookie Banner\n\nWe use cookies to provide the services and features offered on our website and to improve our user experience. Click for details.\n\nACCEPT\nClose GDPR Cookie Banner\nSkip to content\nMeet with Us\nLocations\nCareers\nSearch\nLog In\nBluestone Bank\nPERSONAL\nBUSINESS\nHOME LOANS\nWEALTH & TRUST SERVICES\nMUNICIPAL\nRESOURCES\nABOUT US\n\nYOUR BIG PLANS\nbacked by Bluestone\n\nNurture your hard-earned money with competitive interest rates on deposit products.\n\nOPEN AN ACCOUNT\nBluestone’s Season of Giving and Savings\nLEARN MORE\nABOUT BLUESTONE’S SEASON OF GIVING AND SAVINGS\nMAXIMIZE YOUR SAVINGS\nEarn over 8x\nthe National Average* Savings Rate\nLEARN MORE\nABOUT OUR HIGH-YIELD SAVINGS ACCOUNT\nMobile Banking App\n\nSecurely manage your accounts, transfer funds, and access all your financial tools with just a few taps.\n\nLEARN MORE\nABOUT OUR MOBILE BANKING APP\n(opens in a new tab)\n(opens in a new tab)\nHow do I…\nCHOOSE A SELECTION\nYour partner through it all.\n\nWe’re an independent community bank located in southeastern Massachusetts and are proud to back the communities we call home. We have helped our local area flourish since 1872 and are dedicated to providing caring service and financial insight to families and businesses in Massachusetts, Rhode Island, and New Hampshire—come bank with us!\n\nBluestone can help\nmake it happen.\n\nWith over 150 years of combined experience, Bluestone can guide you through every stage of your financial journey. We can help plan your investment strategy,* whether you’re simply managing your money or looking to buy a home or starting a business. Public entities trust Bluestone for everything from cash management to deposit protection. We think you should too.\n\nPERSONAL\nBUSINESS\nHOME LOANS\nWEALTH & TRUST SERVICES\nMUNICIPAL\n\n*Investment products are not insured by the FDIC, are not deposits, and may lose value.\n\nBank on your hours. Not ours.\n\nMake the most of these features in our online banking and mobile app:\n\nTransfer funds between people, accounts and even between banks. Virtual payments for virtually everyone.\nStay informed about your credit without affecting your credit score. Plus, get financial tips and education thanks to our partnership with SavvyMoney.\nStay on top of your bills with scheduled payments, bill pay, and more.\nAll your transactions, all in one spot.\n(opens in a new tab)\n(opens in a new tab)\nRest Assured,\n\nYour Deposits Are Safe!\n\nWhen it comes to your hard-earned money, you deserve a bank that will guarantee its safety.\n\nAll deposits at Bluestone Bank are 100% insured. This is made possible through the Federal Deposit Insurance Corporation (FDIC), which insures up to $250,000.00 per depositor with the excess over $250,000.00 insured by the Depositors Insurance Fund\n(opens in a new tab)\n (DIF). No depositor has ever lost money in a bank insured by both the FDIC and DIF.\n\nCommunity Giving and Support\nDonations\n\nEmpowering our community through financial support for local initiatives and causes\n\nLEARN MORE\nABOUT DONATIONS\n\nVolunteering\n\nMobilizing our team to actively contribute time and skills to community projects\n\nLEARN MORE\nABOUT VOLUNTEERING\n\nGrants\n\nProviding funding to organizations, and driving positive change in our neighborhoods.\n\nLEARN MORE\nABOUT GRANTS\n\nScholarships\n\nInvesting in the future by supporting educational opportunities for promising students.\n\nLEARN MORE\nABOUT SCHOLARSHIPS\n\nCONTACT US\nPERSONAL\nBUSINESS\nHOME LOANS\nWEALTH & TRUST SERVICES\nMUNICIPAL\nRESOURCES\nABOUT US\nSign up for our\nE-newsletter\n\nRouting #: 211372828\n\nAccessibility Statement\nPatriot Act\nPrivacy Policy\nSitemap\nTerms of Use\nCRA Public File\n(PDF, opens in a new tab)\nMutual Bancorp\n(opens in a new tab)\n\nCopyright ©2025 Bluestone Bank. All Rights Reserved. Member FDIC. Member DIF. Equal Housing Lender. NMLS ID: 403265\n\nFacebook (opens in a new tab)\nLinkedI